title: "TxGraffiti Conjecture 15/3 resolution"
version: "4.0.0-rc1"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.21852504"
date-released: "2026-08-06"
type: software
abstract: >-
  Certificate-backed candidate resolution of TxGraffiti Conjecture 15/3:
  a connected cubic graph on 50 vertices with minimum maximal matching number
  15 and independent domination number 16. The package also contains an exact
  formula-graph identity and a conditional restricted threshold theorem.
